    "sub_ename": "SEMICONDUCTOR DEVICES",
    "describe_ch": "學生將藉由本課程熟悉諸如：二極體、電雙極性電晶體、金屬-半導體場效電晶體、金氧半場效電晶體、接面場效電晶體及光電元件等基礎半導體元件之工作原理。\n",
    "describe_eh": "Students will learn the operation principles and establish physical backgrounds of various fundamental semiconductor devices, including: Diode, BJT, MESFET, MOSFET, JFET and optical devices .\n",
